src/DEPG0213BN.py

MicroPython driver for the DEPG0213BN e-paper panel fitted to the LILYGO TTGO
T5. Upstream is MIT licensed; the copy here has no licence header of its own,
so the terms come from the upstream repository.

    Copyright (c) 2021 Inqbus
    https://github.com/Inqbus/micropython_DEPG0213BN

This copy is trimmed. Upstream also has a partial-refresh method whose
waveform table and command sequence were translated from GPL-3.0 C++ (the
lewisxhe fork of GxEPD, and ESPHome's e-paper component). This firmware only
ever does full refreshes, so that method and its table are left out rather
than redistributed under a licence they may not carry. The blocks of
commented-out C++ that upstream keeps for reference are left out as well.
Everything that remains is the upstream code as published.

